<BaseLayout title="Privacy v1"><article class="legal"><p class="eyebrow">Immutable v1 draft snapshot</p><h1>Privacy Notice v1</h1><div class="notice"><strong>Draft, not final privacy terms.</strong><p>This frozen v1 text has no stated effective date, legal entity, jurisdiction, age rule, retention period, or processor list.</p></div><h2>Local and Cloud</h2><p>Local keeps profile data on the computer that uses it and sends no traffic to AliasMode Cloud. Cloud uses verified account details and encrypted portable-profile sync with a local cache.</p><h2>Analytics</h2><p>App analytics are opt-in. The website has analytics off. A future download-intent measure, if added, would be same-origin and aggregate only. It would use no cookies, IDs, page trails, referrer data, profile data, fingerprinting, ads, or session replay.</p><p><a href="/privacy">View the stable Privacy route</a></p></article></BaseLayout>
